<script setup lang="ts">
import {onMounted,ref} from 'vue'
import {api,messageOf} from '@/api/client'
import {learningApi} from '@/api/learning'
const counts=ref({users:0,bases:0,documents:0,failed:0,pending:0}),error=ref('')
onMounted(async()=>{try{const [users,bases]=await Promise.all([api.get('/admin/users'),learningApi.bases()]);const docs=(await Promise.all(bases.map(b=>learningApi.documents(b.ID)))).flat();counts.value={users:users.data.Total,bases:bases.length,documents:docs.length,failed:docs.filter(d=>d.Status==='failed').length,pending:docs.filter(d=>d.Status==='processing'||d.Status==='uploaded').length}}catch(e){error.value=messageOf(e)}})
</script>
<template><div><header class="page-head"><div><p class="eyebrow">ADMINISTRATION</p><h1>408 管理员工作台</h1><p>维护公共学习内容、处理资料和图谱，管理注册用户及权限。</p></div></header><p v-if="error" class="notice error">{{error}}</p><div class="grid two-col"><section class="card"><h2>用户 {{counts.users}}</h2><p>管理员可授予或撤销管理权限、停用或恢复账号。停用后已有登录令牌立即失效。</p><RouterLink class="primary" to="/exam408/admin/users">用户管理</RouterLink></section><section class="card"><h2>公共资料 {{counts.documents}} · 知识库 {{counts.bases}}</h2><p>处理中 {{counts.pending}} · 失败 {{counts.failed}}</p><RouterLink class="primary" to="/exam408/admin/resources">上传、替换与处理资料</RouterLink></section><section class="card"><h2>考纲与课程</h2><p>普通用户只读公共内容，由管理员持续完善知识点、讲解和题目。</p><RouterLink to="/exam408/admin/knowledge">维护考纲目录 →</RouterLink><br/><RouterLink to="/exam408/admin/assets">维护课程与题库 →</RouterLink></section><section class="card"><h2>图谱维护</h2><p>查看资料生成的节点、关系和来源；替换、删除文件后核查证据更新。</p><RouterLink class="primary" to="/exam408/admin/graph">查看知识图谱</RouterLink></section></div></div></template>
